The project execution isolation architecture was informed by Witden
(https://github.com/zhaozhaozz/witden), Apache-2.0, revision
5a17a1e6ffeb204d9a18acd9020f47e828571fe4.
The minimal manager and runner in this repository are independently implemented;
they do not include Witden desktop, messaging, or employee delegation code.

The headless project agent uses Pi (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent 1.4.0),
https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono, under the MIT License.
The upstream notice is retained in runner/licenses/pi-MIT.txt and the project image.

The public dashboard and single-repository exporter are vendored from
https://github.com/agent-CI-Infra/dashboard, revision
9e57dfaf11fa44606517da454c5732a59d1f7996.
Their MIT and Apache-2.0 license texts are retained in public-board/.
